#59000
"A Narrow Mountain Pass"
"The mountains separate, forming a sharp narrow pass.  From the sliced stone

and rubble, it looks as if some giant had reached out a meaty hand and ripped

the rock asunder.  Moss clings to the walls of the cut in ragged clumps,

finding random purchase on the scorched and blackened rock.  It may be

possible to squeeze north through the gap.  Easier travel can be seen down the

mountain to the south.

"
"[Zithuan] What level do we want this area?  I think another area of it's

current level would be fine, maybe just slightly higher..?

[Zithuan] Added Barkskin to most of the mobs with \"tough bark\" or the like in their desc.

[Elfir] How about making some of the plants tamable? I don't think there are any plant tames yet...

[Maegheera] I'm not sure we want plant tames. I have enough trouble justifying bugs as pets..;)

[Celosia] No plant tames, please.

"
