#59001
"Atop a Narrow Mountain Pass"
"From this vantage point at the head of the pass, a wide valley sprawls to

the north, a thick fog obscuring most of the details below.  A path winds

down a steep incline to the valley floor, the footing insecure in spots. 

Directly to the south, a cleft has been torn into stone.  The barren rock

face is stained an pale, sickly green.  The air here is much warmer than

the chill temperatures of the southern trail, as if the valley was

protected from the harsh mountain winds.

"
"[Maegheera] Done

"
