#59002
"A Path Down the Mountain"
"A veil of mist can be seen to the north, blocking visibility on the path. 

The path winds down the mountain to the north into a valley below, or

southward, up to a pass cut through the mountains.  Patches of burnt

grass are clumped everywhere, carpeting the ground in browns and blacks. 

Stacks of dried, dead flowers and vines clutter the area.  Small piles of

dirt rest in freshly-dug clumps, filling the area around the rotting

vegetation.

"
"[Maegheera] Done

