#59003
"A Cloudy Path Down the Mountain"
"The path winds westward, further down into the valley blow or to the south

toward the mountain pass.  The area is thick with dense clouds of fog that

obscure visibility.  Green ichor is smeared against the granite rock in

macabre, almost intentional-looking patterns.

