#59004
"The Bottom of the Path"
"A short dirt path winds north from here toward the valley floor.  From

this vantage point, the whole panorama appears desolate and abandoned.  A

strange rustling sound can be heard in the distance, but all that is

visible is a field of vines and shrubs.  A thick cloudy haze can be seen

extending its wispy tendrils to the east.

"
"[Maegheera] Done.

