#59005
"A Dirt Path"
"The dirt path winds down from the mountains to the northwest towards

the valley below.  Plant life here is sparse, and what little there is

appears near death or dead.  The soil on the path is itself very dry and

dusty.  A glance to the west reveals massive scarring in the valley, as

if it were once fertile but has been ravaged beyond repair.

"
"[Zithuan] Done

"
