#59006
"The Foot of the Valley"
"This area is chilly from winds buffeting against the mountain.  A dirt

path winds south, up the mountain and out of sight, while the valley

opens to the west.  Grass grows in pale, sickly patches, clumped together

off the path.  Much of the ground is composed of black sand and is unfit

for any more growth.

"
