#59011
"Outside a Small Village"
"The road narrows here to a small opening, surrounded by the towering

mountains.  A long adobe wall borders the southern and eastern edges of the

space, breached by a shiny gate that leads eastward toward a hut of bone and

fur.  Another portal leads southward and blocks further travel in that

direction.  The hilly valley gives way to desolate, blackened fields in the

north.  A rusted metal gong is supported next to the gate, with a pile of

rocks to one side.

"
